Upstream sources this tree derives from.

- https://github.com/2genkidev/buusfury, a disassembly of Dragon Ball Z: Buu's
  Fury. The revision cc53d0cd2d1c167e749419187e2d92017ac07468 is the base of
  tools/gate/gate.py, tools/lint/lints.py, tools/check_links.py,
  tools/testkit.py, tools/incbin.bat, tools/extract/slice_rom.py, scatter.ld,
  rebuild.cmd and extract.cmd. Those files reached this tree through the
  Legacy of Goku II reconstruction, which carried them from that revision.
- The JCALG1 body grammar and encoder in tools/compress/ are carried from the
  same reconstruction tree.
- jcalg1 by Jeremy Collake, https://github.com/jeremycollake/jcalg1, MIT licence,
  copyright (c) 2020 Jeremy Collake. The compressor's MASM source is vendored
  under tools/compress/jcalg1/ with its licence and built by
  tools/compress/build.cmd; no compiled copy of it is distributed here.

No game image is distributed in this repository. The builder supplies the retail
ROM. This project is not affiliated with the rights holders of the game.
